Error [E0311]: Source-owned conversion `.to_float()` is retired
  --> tests/ui/source_owned_numeric_conversion_retired.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |     print(value.to_float())
    |                 ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Explicit conversion belongs to the destination type, so the promised result is visible first
 Fix: Write `Float.from_int(value)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
